    "iCloud 云盘中的备份未做额外加密；开启 iCloud 高级数据保护后由 Apple 端到端加密。恢复前会先备份当前账本，恢复内容需通过完整账本校验才会生效。已连接 Git 的账本恢复后会作为一次本地修改同步到远端；若远端同时有修改，会进入现有的冲突处理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backups in iCloud Drive have no extra encryption; with Advanced Data Protection for iCloud turned on, Apple encrypts them end to end. Before restoring, the current ledger is backed up first, and the restored content takes effect only after it passes full ledger validation. For a ledger connected to Git, the restore syncs to the remote as a local change; if the remote changed at the same time, it goes through the usual conflict review."
          }
        }
      }
    },
