    "保存后自动同步，联网及回到前台时自动重试。后台同步由 iOS 调度；设备首次解锁后可在锁屏时运行。冲突或凭据失效时暂停，账本仍保存在本机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Syncs automatically after saving and retries when online or returning to the app. iOS schedules background sync; it can run on the Lock Screen after the device's first unlock. Paused on conflicts or expired credentials; the ledger stays saved on device."
          }
        }
